values ($lx$angela-liu-lpc-gilbert$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Angela Liu, LPC$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking licensed professional counselor in Gilbert focusing on trauma, grief and relationship issues.$lx$, $lx$吉爾伯特會說國語的執照專業諮商師，專長創傷、悲傷及人際關係議題。$lx$, $lx$Angela Liu is a Licensed Professional Counselor (Arizona LPC-20942) with an office at 1760 E Pecos Rd, Suite 307, in Gilbert. The profile lists trauma and PTSD, grief and relationship issues as the main focus, and Liu works with individuals from children aged 6 to 10 and preteens to adults, using approaches that include attachment-based therapy, CBT, cognitive processing therapy and DBT. Liu lists $135 per session and plans including Aetna, Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, Humana and Medicare. Liu speaks English and Mandarin. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Angela Liu 是亞利桑那州執照專業諮商師（LPC-20942），辦公室位於吉爾伯特（Gilbert）1760 E Pecos Rd, Suite 307。個人頁面列出主要專長為創傷與創傷後壓力症候群、悲傷輔導及人際關係議題，服務對象從 6 至 10 歲兒童、青少年前期到成人，採用依附取向治療、認知行為治療（CBT）、認知處理治療（CPT）及辯證行為治療（DBT）等方法。每次諮商費用列為 135 美元，可使用 Aetna、Blue Cross Blue Shield、Cigna、Humana 及 Medicare 等保險。能說英語及國語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Gilbert$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$1760 E Pecos Rd, Suite 307, Gilbert, AZ 85295$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/angela-liu-gilbert-az/1816093$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Angela Liu, LPC$lx$, $lx$Gilbert$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

