values ($lx$june-lin-lee-lmft-tempe$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$June Lin-Lee, LMFT$lx$, null, $lx$Tempe marriage and family therapist offering Christian and Asian family counseling in English, Mandarin and Taiwanese.$lx$, $lx$坦佩婚姻與家族治療師，提供基督教及亞裔家庭諮商，可說英語、國語及台語。$lx$, $lx$June Lin-Lee is a Marriage and Family Therapist (Arizona LMFT-16277) with an office at 1200 E Southern Ave in Tempe. The profile lists Christian and Asian family counseling, relationship issues and women's issues as the main focus, and Lin-Lee sees teens, adults and seniors as individuals, couples and families, using approaches that include attachment-based therapy, Christian counseling, CBT and culturally sensitive therapy. Lin-Lee lists $125 per session. Lin-Lee speaks English, Mandarin and Taiwanese. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$June Lin-Lee 是亞利桑那州執照婚姻與家族治療師（LMFT-16277），辦公室位於坦佩（Tempe）1200 E Southern Ave。個人頁面列出主要專長為基督教及亞裔家庭諮商、人際關係議題及女性議題，服務青少年、成人及長者，提供個人、伴侶及家庭諮商，採用依附取向治療、基督教諮商、認知行為治療及文化敏感治療等方法。每次諮商費用列為 125 美元。能說英語、國語及台語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Tempe$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$1200 E Southern Ave, Tempe, AZ 85282$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/june-lin-lee-tempe-az/795868$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$June Lin-Lee, LMFT$lx$, $lx$Tempe$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

