values ($lx$kuo-yi-chung-phd-mesa$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Kuo-Yi Chung, PhD (Psychologist)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking psychologist in Mesa for depression, anxiety and psychological testing and evaluation.$lx$, $lx$梅薩會說國語的心理師，專長憂鬱、焦慮及心理測驗與評估。$lx$, $lx$Kuo-Yi Chung, PhD, is a psychologist licensed in Arizona (license 4180) with an office at 1830 S Alma School Rd, Suite 112, in Mesa. The profile lists depression, anxiety and testing and evaluation as the main focus, and Dr. Chung sees preteens, teens, adults and seniors as individuals, couples and families, using CBT, family systems, multicultural and solution-focused approaches. Dr. Chung lists $185 per session and plans including Aetna, Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, Optum and UnitedHealthcare. Dr. Chung speaks English and Mandarin. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Kuo-Yi Chung 博士是亞利桑那州執照心理師（執照號碼 4180），辦公室位於梅薩（Mesa）1830 S Alma School Rd, Suite 112。個人頁面列出主要專長為憂鬱、焦慮及心理測驗與評估，服務青少年前期至長者，提供個人、伴侶及家庭諮商，採用認知行為治療、家族系統、多元文化及焦點解決等取向。每次諮商費用列為 185 美元，可使用 Aetna、Blue Cross Blue Shield、Cigna、Optum 及 UnitedHealthcare 等保險。能說英語及國語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Mesa$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$1830 S Alma School Rd, Suite 112, Mesa, AZ 85210$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/kuo-yi-chung-mesa-az/102064$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Kuo-Yi Chung, PhD (Psychologist)$lx$, $lx$Mesa$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
