values ($lx$michelle-fowler-lpc-mesa$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Michelle Fowler, LPC$lx$, null, $lx$Mesa counselor and certified EFT therapist for couples and ADHD in relationships; speaks Mandarin.$lx$, $lx$梅薩專業諮商師及認證情緒取向治療（EFT）治療師，專長伴侶關係及 ADHD 對關係的影響，會說國語。$lx$, $lx$Michelle Fowler is a Licensed Professional Counselor (Arizona LPC-20211) with an office at 3048 E Baseline Rd, Suite 107, in Mesa. The profile lists marital and premarital counseling, ADHD and the impact of ADHD on relationships as the main focus; Fowler is a certified Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT) therapist and works with adults as individuals and couples. Fowler lists $150 per session and is out of network with insurers, providing a bill clients can submit. Besides English, Fowler lists Mandarin, Portuguese, Serbian and Spanish. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Michelle Fowler 是亞利桑那州執照專業諮商師（LPC-20211），辦公室位於梅薩（Mesa）3048 E Baseline Rd, Suite 107。個人頁面列出主要專長為婚姻與婚前諮商、ADHD 及 ADHD 對人際關係的影響；Fowler 是認證情緒取向治療（EFT）治療師，服務成人個人及伴侶。每次諮商費用列為 150 美元，不在保險網絡內，但可提供帳單供客戶自行申請理賠。除英語外，也列出國語、葡萄牙語、塞爾維亞語及西班牙語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Mesa$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$3048 E Baseline Rd, Suite 107, Mesa, AZ 85204$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/michelle-fowler-mesa-az/436792$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Michelle Fowler, LPC$lx$, $lx$Mesa$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
