values ($lx$petty-go-lamft-glendale$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Petty P. Go, LAMFT$lx$, null, $lx$Glendale marriage and family therapist for family conflict, couples and grief, in English, Mandarin and Taiwanese.$lx$, $lx$格倫代爾婚姻與家族治療師，專長家庭衝突、伴侶及悲傷輔導，可說英語、國語及台語。$lx$, $lx$Petty P. Go, MS, MEd, is a Licensed Associate Marriage and Family Therapist (Arizona LAMFT-10655) with an office at 17250 N 43rd Ave, Suite 4, in Glendale. The profile lists family conflict, marital and premarital counseling and grief as the main focus, and Go sees children aged 6 to 10, adults and seniors as individuals, couples and families, using CBT, family systems, solution-focused and culturally sensitive approaches. Go lists $125 per session and notes that insurance is not accepted currently. Go speaks English, Mandarin and Taiwanese. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Petty P. Go（碩士）是亞利桑那州執照副婚姻與家族治療師（LAMFT-10655），辦公室位於格倫代爾（Glendale）17250 N 43rd Ave, Suite 4。個人頁面列出主要專長為家庭衝突、婚姻與婚前諮商及悲傷輔導，服務 6 至 10 歲兒童、成人及長者，提供個人、伴侶及家庭諮商，採用認知行為治療、家族系統、焦點解決及文化敏感等取向。每次諮商費用列為 125 美元，目前不接受保險。能說英語、國語及台語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Glendale$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$17250 N 43rd Ave, Suite 4, Glendale, AZ 85308$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/petty-p-go-glendale-az/780294$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Petty P. Go, LAMFT$lx$, $lx$Glendale$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
