values ($lx$shiru-zhou-lpc-scottsdale$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Shiru Zhou, LPC$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking counselor in Scottsdale focusing on neurodivergence, trauma and anxiety; offers EMDR.$lx$, $lx$斯科茨代爾會說國語的專業諮商師，專長神經多樣性、創傷及焦慮，提供 EMDR 治療。$lx$, $lx$Shiru Zhou is a Licensed Professional Counselor (Arizona LPC-23802) with an office at 6424 E Greenway Pkwy, Unit 150, in Scottsdale. The profile lists neurodivergence, trauma and PTSD and anxiety as the main focus, and Zhou sees adults and seniors as individuals, couples and families, using approaches that include EMDR, acceptance and commitment therapy, motivational interviewing and person-centered therapy. Zhou lists private pay at $180 per session and plans including Aetna, Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, Optum and UnitedHealthcare. Zhou speaks English and Mandarin. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Shiru Zhou 是亞利桑那州執照專業諮商師（LPC-23802），辦公室位於斯科茨代爾（Scottsdale）6424 E Greenway Pkwy, Unit 150。個人頁面列出主要專長為神經多樣性、創傷與創傷後壓力症候群及焦慮，服務成人及長者，提供個人、伴侶及家庭諮商，採用眼動減敏與歷程更新療法（EMDR）、接納與承諾治療（ACT）、動機式晤談及個人中心治療等方法。自費每次 180 美元，可使用 Aetna、Blue Cross Blue Shield、Cigna、Optum 及 UnitedHealthcare 等保險。能說英語及國語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Scottsdale$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$6424 E Greenway Pkwy, Unit 150, Scottsdale, AZ 85254$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/shiru-zhou-scottsdale-az/1034137$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Shiru Zhou, LPC$lx$, $lx$Scottsdale$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
