values ($lx$wen-chien-lin-lpc-tempe$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Wen-Chien Lin, LPC$lx$, null, $lx$Tempe licensed professional counselor for adults, offering CBT, DBT, EMDR and narrative therapy in English, Mandarin and Taiwanese.$lx$, $lx$坦佩執照專業諮商師，服務成人，提供 CBT、DBT、EMDR 及敘事治療，可說英語、國語及台語。$lx$, $lx$Wen-Chien Lin is a Licensed Professional Counselor (Arizona license 15861) with an office at 2131 E Broadway Rd, Suite 9, in Tempe. The profile lists work with adults as individuals and in groups, using approaches that include CBT, DBT, EMDR, narrative and narrative exposure therapy, and culturally sensitive and multicultural therapy. Lin lists $150 per session and plans including Aetna, Anthem / Blue Cross Blue Shield, Carelon Behavioral Health, Cigna and Quest Behavioral Health. Lin speaks English, Mandarin and Taiwanese. Languages as listed on this therapist's Psychology Today profile, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Wen-Chien Lin 是亞利桑那州執照專業諮商師（執照號碼 15861），辦公室位於坦佩（Tempe）2131 E Broadway Rd, Suite 9。個人頁面列出服務對象為成人，提供個人及團體諮商，採用認知行為治療（CBT）、辯證行為治療（DBT）、EMDR、敘事治療與敘事暴露治療，以及文化敏感與多元文化治療等方法。每次諮商費用列為 150 美元，可使用 Aetna、Anthem／Blue Cross Blue Shield、Carelon Behavioral Health、Cigna 及 Quest Behavioral Health 等保險。能說英語、國語及台語。語言資訊依據其 Psychology Today 個人頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Tempe$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$2131 E Broadway Rd, Suite 9, Tempe, AZ 85282$lx$, null, null, null, $lx$https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/therapists/wen-chien-lin-tempe-az/1590516$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Wen-Chien Lin, LPC$lx$, $lx$Tempe$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$psychologytoday.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$, $lx$therapist counselor mental health$lx$, $lx$心理諮商 心理治療$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
